    {
      "id": "invocation",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Invocation"
    },
    {
      "id": "responsivereading",
      "type": "responsiveReading",
      "entries": [
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Blessed be the holy Trinity, "
                },
                {
                  "type": "symbol",
                  "name": "cross"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " one God, who forgives all our sin, whose mercy endures forever."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Amen."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prayer",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Prayer"
    },
    {
      "id": "responsivereading-2",
      "type": "responsiveReading",
      "entries": [
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Almighty God, to whom all hearts are open, all desires known, and from whom no secrets are hidden; cleanse the thoughts of our hearts by the inspiration of your Holy Spirit, that we may perfectly love you and worthily magnify your holy name, through Jesus Christ our Lord."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Amen."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "confession-of-sins",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Confession of Sins"
    },
    {
      "id": "responsivereading-3",
      "type": "responsiveReading",
      "entries": [
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1 John 1:8-9"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Holy God, holy and mighty, holy and immortal, have mercy on us. For self-centered living, and for failing to walk with humility and gentleness:"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Holy God, holy and mighty, holy and immortal, have mercy on us."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "For longing to have what is not ours, and for failing to give thanks for what is ours:"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Holy God, holy and mighty, holy and immortal, have mercy on us."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "For angry deeds, for hurtful words, for uncharitable thoughts, and for those sins we do not even remember committing:"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Holy God, holy and mighty, holy and immortal, have mercy on us."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "For idleness in witnessing for Jesus Christ, and for squandering the gifts of love and grace:"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Holy God, holy and mighty, holy and immortal, have mercy on us."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "For all the wrong we have done, and all the good we have failed to do:"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Holy God, holy and mighty, holy and immortal, have mercy on us."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "God, who is rich in mercy, loved us even when we were dead in sin, and made us alive together with Christ. By grace you have been saved. In the name of  Jesus Christ, your sins are forgiven. Almighty God strengthen you with power through the Holy Spirit, that Christ may live in your hearts through faith."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Amen."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "reader": "M",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "In the peace of forgiveness, let us praise the Lord!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
