      "items": [
        {
          "id": "bible-classes",
          "title": "Bible Classes",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Bible classes and Sunday School are on summer break and will resume in August."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "feed-my-starving-children",
          "title": "Feed My Starving Children",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Do you want to make an impact on hungry kids? If you are available Saturday, June 20, 12 to 2pm, we will meet at Feed My Starving Children, 1100 W Grove Parkway, Tempe, 85283. We will pack meals of vitamins, vegetables, soy and rice into bags and boxes that are then shipped globally."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Contact Sarah Gulden, 602-501-5906, or sjg480@cox.net to reserve your spot!"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Please RSVP as soon as possible, setup is being finalized shortly.",
                  "marks": [
                    "bold"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "caring-cards",
          "title": "Caring Cards",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Father's Day cards have been added as June 21 is coming soon. Thank you for choosing our handmade cards available for a cost of at least $1 per card to help pay for supplies. The Caring Card Ministry is a LOG ministry"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "service-opportunities-at-lamb-of-god",
          "title": "Service Opportunities at Lamb of God",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "You are invited and encouraged to share your unique gifts and become a vital part of our church family’s mission. Volunteering is more than just completing a task; it is a way to live out our faith and grow in fellowship with one another."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "See the poster in the narthex to see what volunteers our church needs. Then decide where you can help—and let us know if some area is missing from the list."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "align": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1 Peter 4:10"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
